"en_raw": "Kume"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "100168fd",
"en_raw": "We're in the same class again this year, Murase"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "a30163da",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "0f2e17ff",
"en_raw": "By the way, Kume"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "63b21dcd",
"en_raw": "Um, there's something on your back..."
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "5d6780f1",
"en_raw": "...I know"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "d5b40521",
"en_raw": "Yuasa and them stuck it on"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "c773edf7",
"en_raw": "I'm just pretending"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "55f59438",
"en_raw": "not to notice"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "f339d5a1",
"en_raw": "Yuasa and them..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "4afffd0b",
"en_raw": "Those guys do such amusing things"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "f2bc14aa",
"en_raw": "I'll make them understand"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "0ac69eba",
"en_raw": "where this leads..."
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "baeb2477",
"en_raw": "Hey Murase"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "564167c2",
"en_raw": "Yuasa and them are infuriating, aren't they?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "213c7074",
"en_raw": "But you don't have to hold back"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "8283f884",
"en_raw": "...Emotions like that"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "cf20292a",
"en_raw": "if you suppress them too much"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "eab127d8",
"en_raw": "you'll die young"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "41a5fa67",
